{"quest_id": 4816, "name": "霧中の戦い", "description": "立ち込める霧の中、\n天狗山の主が姿を現す。\n＜特定のタイミングで霧が発生＞\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "modifier_notes": ["特定のタイミングで霧が発生"], "event": "討妖の狙撃手", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920082, "map_no": 3934, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "exp": 250, "gold": 1000, "drops": [{"card": 19, "c": 1}, {"card": 238, "c": 1}, {"card": 59, "c": 1}, {"item": 2001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 2}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 19, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "base_hp": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100320, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 239, "global_id": 238, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "base_hp": 2000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2099520, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 107, "global_id": 106, "spawn_sec": 20}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 81, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100304, "race_id": 4, "change_condition": 4, "missile_id": 75, "missile": {"speed": 4.0}, "master_id": 238, "global_id": 237, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 4, "to_ticks": 1, "to_global_id": 238, "spawn_sec": 28}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1000, "base_hp": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100320, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 239, "global_id": 238, "from_condition": 4, "trigger_ticks": 1}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 10000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 230, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 23, "attack_interval": 89, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2108800, "race_id": 4, "missile_id": 77, "missile": {"speed": 2.0}, "master_id": 30104, "global_id": 3723, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 44}], "popups": [" 　　　悪天候：霧\n\n・敵味方の『射程』減少\n・一部の味方は影響を受けない"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "かなり上まで登ってきたというのに、\n天狗の姿は見当たりませんね……。", "face": "l6991b1ab0cea"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "――ん？　彼奴らはいったい？\n……ほう、どうやら人間のようだな。\n斯様な場所で人を目にするとは珍しい。", "face": "u440"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "見たところ、自らの意思で山に踏み入ったようだな。\n……いいだろう。我ら天狗の山に踏み入る資格が\nあるか神通力で試してくれよう。", "face": "u440"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "――ほ、報告ッ！\n霧が発生していて前線が混乱しています！\nそれに、天狗も現れました！", "face": "lf6f8f58a9d3b"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "そ、そんな……！\n申し訳ありません、王子。視界が悪くて、\n遠くに矢を射る事ができそうにないです……。", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "まずいですね……。\n霧が出ている時は、普段通り遠くの敵に\n攻撃を当てる事は困難でしょう。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "いつものように戦っては危険というわけですね。\n王子、慎重な采配をお願いします。", "face": "l7305c7df068c"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "ほう、人間のくせになかなかやりおる。", "face": "u440"}, {"name": "アオバ", "text": "――むッ！？\nあの少女は……？　背に……羽がある！？\nまさか、あの方こそが探し求めていた天狗様では！", "face": "u441"}, {"name": "コノハ", "text": "然り。我が名は天狗山の主、コノハ。\nして、何用だ人間よ？", "face": "u440"}, {"name": "コノハ", "text": "この山は天狗の棲む神聖な山ぞ。\n戯れに汚すのであれば、\n其方らを山の肥やしとする事も容易いのだぞ。", "face": "u440"}, {"name": "アオバ", "text": "天狗様！　私の話を聞いて下さい！\n実は、私は酒呑童子を倒す力を得る為に、\n貴方を探しておりました。", "face": "u441"}, {"name": "アオバ", "text": "どうか私めを弟子にして頂きたい！\n鬼に殺された故郷の者たちの仇を討つため、\n天下無双の力を私は体得したいのです！", "face": "u441"}, {"name": "コノハ", "text": "ほう、鬼とな？　しかし、其方は人間であろう？\n自らの力を計らぬその無謀な志は、\n身の滅びと帰するであろうな。", "face": "u440"}, {"name": "コノハ", "text": "早々にこの山から立ち去るがよい。", "face": "u440"}, {"name": "アオバ", "text": "ま、待って下さい！\nああっ……。行ってしまいました……。", "face": "u441"}, {"name": "フドウ", "text": "アオバ殿、天狗を追いましょう。\n今ならば、追いつけるかもしれぬ。", "face": "u238"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920082_3934", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 8, "y": 94}, {"k": "b", "x": 8, "y": 254}, {"k": "b", "x": 8, "y": 480}, {"k": "m", "x": 105, "y": 137, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 97, "y": 261, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 109, "y": 451, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 229, "y": 412, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 347, "y": 358, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 348, "y": 271, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 495, "y": 242, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 631, "y": 205, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 492, "y": 383, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 624, "y": 326, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 392, "y": 69, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 537, "y": 71, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 734, "y": 149, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 828, "y": 273, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 852, "y": 124, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 223, "y": 241, "id": 215}, {"k": "r", "x": 516, "y": 307, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 225, "y": 318, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 151, "y": 366, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 57, "y": 191, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 377, "y": 416, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 273, "y": 164, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 462, "y": 191, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 565, "y": 156, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 711, "y": 268, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 692, "y": 346, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 200, "y": 117, "id": 310}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true}